tsushi(歌手)","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130956","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"斬戯","creatorId":"vndb:s46435","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s46435","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s46435","name":"斬戯","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:130957","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c51383","characterName":"舘山寺 玲","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"53247","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"182369"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17594"],"vndbCharacterId":"c51383"},"originalCharacterName":"舘山寺 玲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The school's queen of cross dressing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An honor student known of throughout the school, he is especially popular with the girls and is always surrounded by them. He actually likes girls and only cross dresses because it makes him popular with them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While many think his family is rich he actually poor and has a part time job to help out his family. He lives in the same neighborhood as Chiharu so he gets along well with him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After a certain incident with Masato they are on bad terms and because Masato makes him conscious of how girl-like he is he can't get along with him. He is chosen as one of Masato's lovers for the project but does everything he can to avoid him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51383"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が嫌いな、学園の女装女王"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園内でも評判の優等生。特に女子に人気があり、いつも周囲に女の子がいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある出来事がきっかけで、主人公と対立してからは犬猿の仲に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男だとわかっていても、女を意識させられるので主人公は非常に苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千晴とは家が近所でそれなりに仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家は裕福かと思われているが、じつは貧乏でアルバイトして家計を助けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普通に女子が好きで、女装も女子に受けがいいからやっているだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当然、主人公と結ばれることには否定的でなんとか他の男の娘に押し付けられないかと考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は穏やだが二面性があり、主人公に対してだけは辛辣な態度をとっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17594","sourceWorkId":"23725","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園内でも評判の優等生。 特に女子に人気があり、いつも周囲に女の子がいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある出来事がきっかけで主人公と対立し、以降は犬猿の仲に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男だと分かっていても女を意識させられるので、主人公は非常に苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"千晴とは家が近所でそれなりに仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家は裕福だと思われているが、じつは貧乏でアルバイトして家計を助けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普通に女子が好きで、女装も女子にウケがいいからやっているだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当然、主人公と恋人になることには否定的で、なんとか回避できないかと考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「クスクス…… 男の娘相手に意識しているの？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53247"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4f4ae204ae3a493894c841c33e8ac0b56f86561cee45bf77aac98b9b8a3c751.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/234e111d6468d46b346df3ea9d65b3b6db875796541b85c17f506882303b66d3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"清水美紗","creatorId":"vndb:s1975","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1975","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1975","name":"よもぎかすみ(蓬かすみ)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:182369:53247:21151:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c51384","characterName":"長久 千晴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"53248","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"182369"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17595"],"vndbCharacterId":"c51384"},"originalCharacterName":"長久 千晴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The boisterous cross dressing BL fanatic kouhai."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He cross dresses to see love between men from a woman's viewpoint, he wishes to observe such a relationship from afar to the end."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While he is reluctant in being chosen as one of Masato's lovers it is a chance for him to see love between men up close. He is constantly encouraging Masato to pursue a same sex love(much to his dismay) as well as one-sidedly talking to him about BL, they get along quite well."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51384"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"後輩の腐女装男子"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やかましいくらいに賑やか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装は女の立場から男同士の恋愛を見たいという、自分の趣味を強調するためのもので、自分は遠くから男同士のイチャイチャを眺める。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"候補に選ばれたのは不本意に思っているのだが、近くでマジの男同士のマジ恋愛が見れるかもと期待している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にはしきりに男の娘との恋愛を勧めてくるので、気持ち悪がられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男と男の娘のからみを見たいことに夢中で、主人公に接近してくるが、自分の女装レベルの高さには気づいていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは普段から一方的にＢＬを啓蒙してくる程度に仲が良い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17595","sourceWorkId":"23725","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"やかましいくらいに賑やかなBL愛好家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装は女の立場から男同士の恋愛を見たいという考えからで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あくまで自分は遠くから男同士のイチャイチャを眺めていたい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋人候補に選ばれたのは不本意だが、近くで男同士のマジ恋愛が見れるかもと、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にはしきりに男の娘との恋愛を勧めてくるので気持ち悪がられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男と男の娘のからみを見たい一心で主人公に接近してくるが、自分の女装レベルの高さには気づいていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは普段から一方的にBLを啓蒙してくる程度に仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「先輩、私は男同士が粘膜を擦りつけあう姿を見たいだけなんです！ その姿が尊い！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53248"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f5c0a0ddcc357592d756d0a94d539d6d909bfed503b020f5c4cc40530454975.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6f/6f30aab287b64136fafbb345573ad0656671a560be9e588b13b49b4824fc3c6b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山口瑞樹","creatorId":"vndb:s338","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s338","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s338","name":"山口 瑞樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:182369:53248:16462:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c51385","characterName":"蓬田 昌","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"53249","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"182369"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17596"],"vndbCharacterId":"c51385"},"originalCharacterName":"蓬田 昌","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The cool and calm crossing dressing teacher."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is one of the people in charge of the \"cross dressers pregnancy project\" and also a candidate. He aims to figure out how a cross dresser can be impregnated but so far hasn't succeed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a researcher before a teacher so he cross dresses of his own accord in order to observe the pregnancy process. He has refined his sexual technique to improve the efficiency of his research so many students have become captivated by his technique."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Claims to be born from a male and trap parent."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c51385"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールな女装教師"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装している教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回のプロジェクトの責任者かつ候補の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生物学的興味で男の娘が妊娠するプロセスを解き明かそうとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学究の徒であり、主人公たちを研究対象としか見ていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教師というより研究者であり、自分が女装して妊娠するプロセスを観察しようとしているが、まだ妊娠には成功していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"研究の効率化のため、搾精技術は卓越しているが、研究対象をまったく考慮しないため、あまりの気持ちよさに虜になってしまう学生が何人もでてきて過去に問題を起こしたことがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回の候補には自ら進んで参加しているが、学園からは自重するように釘を指されている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"17596","sourceWorkId":"23725","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"女装している教師。 今回のプロジェクトの責任者かつ候補の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生物学的興味で男の娘が妊娠するプロセスを解き明かそうとしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学究の徒であり、主人公たちを研究対象としか見てない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教師というより研究者であり、自ら女装して妊娠のプロセスを観察しようとしているが、まだ妊娠には成功していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"研究の効率化のために搾精技術は卓越しているが、あまりの気持ち良さに虜になってしまう学生が続出する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回も自分から進んで参加しているが、学園からは自重するように釘を指されている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「テストには出ないが覚えておけ、男の娘は妊娠する」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"53249"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/5558c068bbc08a96911a1016023ceb4b555eb08697ed9b0656ca97460659ad29.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b92051273051d7e36f6664d74640a3e3001205160eb10911cc505e54366be594.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小山さほみ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:182369:53249:6359:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c51407","characterName":"野木 勝人","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55388","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"182369"}],"egsCharacterIds":["17597"],"vndbCharacterId":"c51407"},"originalCharacterName":"野木 勝人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Main character of \"cross dressers pregnancy pr